WEBVTT

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:04.250
That's why I have to go!

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:10.790
Luna!

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.780
Bell!

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:26.390
After overcoming various problems while crossing the vast ocean, we finally arrived at the mainland.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:33.360
Almost as if to refuse us landing, a cliff blocked our way.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:46.260
We searched for a good place to land and enjoyed a much needed snack for the first time, but...

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.510
How is it?

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:16.710
It's pretty strange...

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.780
Adam has the same nanomachines in his body as you, right Luna?

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.290
Yes. Is that the cause of his fever?

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:28.260
Nope. But I can't find anythin' else wrong with him.

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:32.540
Weren't the nanomachines also supposed to cure diseases?

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:36.740
That's right! Your gash healed in a single day, didn't it?

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:40.110
Why would Adam get sick?

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:43.600
You're right. I dunno that either.

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:46.640
Maybe there's a problem with the nanomachines.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:48.400
Once more.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:14.010
That's it! So that's what it was!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.040
What was it?

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:24.290
Different nanos changed the nanos that entered Adam and Luna's bodies into malignant nanos.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:25.860
Malignant?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:29.130
I didn't notice sooner 'cuz they're so similar

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:30.930
And that's the cause?

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:32.430
Probably.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:36.290
It spread quickly, almost like a virus.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:39.440
But why is something like that in Adam?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.640
That's right! I mean, there hasn't been anything like that before, has there?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:44.910
Good point.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.630
At the very least, there weren't any on that island.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.240
Adam was hurt on his hand today.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:59.010
That's probably when it got in.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:03.810
So if the malignant ones got into Luna's body...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.990
There's a chance Luna would suffer the same condition.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.080
Are we okay, though?

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.150
Other'n Luna, nobody has the nanos, so you should be fine.

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:18.740
There's no use worryin' about it.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:21.250
Then what should we do about Adam?

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:24.290
We don't have any means to cure him here.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:29.730
Let's change our route and head for the terraforming machine closest to here.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:34.560
There might be some equipment we can use to treat him if we go there.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.530
It doesn't seem like we have any other choice.

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:38.500
Chako...

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.190
Aye-aye.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:49.680
The main computer is here...

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.340
...and our location is here.

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.240
So, the nearest terraforming machine...

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:57.960
...is there, right?

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.980
It's 120km north.

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:04.790
Look like we'll have to break off from the river and go over land.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.660
Let's go.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:36.510
Hey...

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:38.800
That's bright.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.900
Activating Gravity Control Unit.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:49.530
Lifting off!

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:57.290
Engines ahead full. System all green.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:07.860
That's a nice breeze.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.400
Howard, let's go.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.610
Got it.

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:25.040
Orion: Launch!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.400
Heading 090°.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.490
Launch!

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:56.350
Goin' good! If the wind keeps blowin' like this, it'll be about two more hours.

00:08:02.090 --> 00:08:05.430
Keep it up. You just have to persevere a little longer.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.840
Still?

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:19.790
It's a forest.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.260
Bell, it's a forest!

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:25.560
I spotted a forest.

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.260
I see it.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:46.380
What's up with this forest?

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.400
What's wrong, Howard?

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.010
What's that?

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:15.810
It's a city.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:19.750
What's going on here?

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.830
Looks like there was civilization on this planet after all.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.300
Does that mean Adam's kind?

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:29.240
Didn't Adam come from another planet?

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:31.300
I don't know.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:34.340
Let's check it out.

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:41.730
If there's a hospital, there may be something we can treat him with.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.260
You're right.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.300
Maybe this is a hospital.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.050
Maybe. There aren't any other worthwhile buildings, at least.

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:03.590
You're right.

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:07.640
Alright, let's go.

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.210
Wait!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.990
We should proceed around here with the greatest caution.

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:19.410
Don't exaggerate. It's just some ruined building.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:23.090
Just like that time with Adam, there may be someone inside.

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.340
Don't startle me! In a dilapidated building like this?

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.360
No, it's just as Bell said.

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:33.890
Yes. The fact that there's still a town here...

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.960
...means it's possible someone is still living here.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:38.540
That's true.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:43.150
And there's also still the malignant nanos. It's best to take care!

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.610
Then I'll stay behind and keep watch for you all.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.330
Right, Chako? You're all the scouting party.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.050
Take the lead.

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:01.710
Don't order me around when you're scared stiff!

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.100
You butthead!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.560
What?

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:06.290
Let's go.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.200
Let's stop.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:16.490
♫ The wise cat hides its claws... ♫

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:18.780
Hey, wait up!

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:24.930
It's pretty amazing in here.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.550
Let's split up and search.

00:11:39.100 --> 00:11:40.230
Don't touch me!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:54.290
This is the result of technological advancement? It all seems so futile.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:02.130
There doesn't seem to be anything useful.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:02.990
Yeah.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:20.200
What, it's just a specimen.

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:24.440
You're an annoyin' one, ain't'cha?

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:28.410
I thought I was going to die.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:35.460
How is it?

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.240
How about there?

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:39.630
Useless.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:41.630
There wasn't anything this way either.

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.750
Huh? Where's Kaoru?

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.510
This way!

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:51.550
This is...

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.760
Medicine, right?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.190
Let's check it out.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.040
No good. The medicine's decomposed.

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.060
How long has it been here?

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:07.340
Let's see...

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:11.460
I think it's from five hundred to a thousand years ago.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:14.610
The ruins Adam was in were the same age, right?

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:30.660
This writing is definitely...

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:33.590
Hey, look!

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.590
That's the same writing that was in the ruins!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:38.840
Then here is where...

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.500
...Adam's kind were living?

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:44.760
I can't say so conclusively, but...

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:48.890
...but then, why was Adam in a spaceship?

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:12.210
Everyone...

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:24.290
Did you find anything we can treat Adam with?

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:26.090
No.

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:27.740
Oh.

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:32.910
Adam was suffering so much, I couldn't watch any more.

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:40.600
Let's give up on here and hurry to the terraforming machine.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:44.010
--Good idea.
--Now that that's decided, let's get out of here!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:58.680
I see it!

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:01.300
Chako!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.330
That's it! We're here!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:09.330
Looks like we've arrived at the terraforming machine.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:29.280
What's that?

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:32.760
Something weird has appeared in front of the terraforming machine.

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:33.890
Be careful!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.010
Kaoru.

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:36.960
Taking cover behind an outcropping.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.280
Kaoru! Hurry, behind that rubble!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:21.180
Alright!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.600
Howard, let's take cover inside!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.780
M-My hips...

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.530
That attack...

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:39.850
I'll go ask!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.190
Hey, what happened?

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.500
We were shot at.

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:51.510
Out of the blue, without any warning!

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:55.040
Damn it! You trying to kill us?

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:57.290
What's going on here?

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:00.210
Howard! Bell!

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:01.680
Are you hurt?

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:06.060
It would have been close if not for my lightning reflexes.

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.410
What about the attack?

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:08.990
It's stopped for the moment.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:11.090
Why did it shoot at us, though?

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.210
I don't know.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.660
Maybe there's someone inside that facility.

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.040
I'll go check.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:26.500
We know that Adam's in a precarious position.

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:27.930
Luna...

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:34.150
Right now, if there's anything that can cure Adam's sickness, it's inside that facility.

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:35.840
That's why I have to go!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.690
But why you, Luna?

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:44.800
There's a high probability the ones who made this terraforming machine are of Adam's kind.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:49.300
The same nanos that are in Adam's body are in me.

00:17:49.530 --> 00:17:53.010
So it might identify me as being of Adam's kind.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.300
No way! It's too dangerous!

00:17:55.640 --> 00:18:00.100
It's okay! It's the same as when we entered Adam's spaceship, right?

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:04.230
And we have the card we used that time!

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:05.880
But...

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.230
I said it's okay!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.060
I'll be careful.

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:11.240
If it shoots at me, I'll run away immediately.

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:12.960
In that case, I'll go with you!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.440
No way! I'll go alone!

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:16.940
Let's do this:

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:21.440
As far as we've seen, the enemy has only one weapon.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:26.240
When the time comes, I'll act as a decoy to confuse it.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:29.050
In that case, I'll help too!

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:32.580
Okay! Let's plan the operation!

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:38.950
You ready, Shingo?

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:42.930
As soon as we go, you go too!

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.160
Got it.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.860
Everyone, be careful.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:50.280
Now!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.840
Shingo!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:15.250
Kaoru and Shingo are in position.

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.610
Menori and Howard are okay too.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:19.860
Luna...

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:21.480
It's okay.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:25.190
If anything happens, I'll come save you right away.

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.540
Thanks.

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:00.250
Wait!

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:06.480
Our friend is sick, and I'm looking for medicine to help him.

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.780
I just want to go inside and look for medicine.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:14.650
We don't want to destroy anything, so we don't want to fight you!

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.430
Please... open the door!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.060
People are unnecessary.

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:31.750
Luna!

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:32.430
Let's go!

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:34.860
Over here!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.230
Hey!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.540
Over here!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:43.710
Are you okay?

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:44.460
Yes.

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:45.250
Let's go back.

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.090
People are unnecessary.

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:54.590
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:02.430
Take this!

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.710
Alright! The door's open!

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:01.750
You did it! Way to go, Kaoru!

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.490
Luna, were you hurt?

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:16.150
No.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:18.440
Did something happen?

00:22:20.050 --> 00:22:21.440
I heard a voice.

00:22:26.730 --> 00:22:27.480
A voice?

00:22:28.600 --> 00:22:31.830
We didn't hear anything like that.

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:33.400
What did you hear it say?

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:39.030
It said, "People are unnecessary."

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:06.630
What did it mean, "People are unnecessary"?

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:10.940
And who does that voice belong to?

00:23:10.940 --> 00:23:15.550
To help Adam, we entered the sub-terraforming machine...

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:18.250
...and there we discovered a startlin' truth!

00:23:18.890 --> 00:23:21.930
And the one who told us that truth...

00:23:22.490 --> 00:23:23.500
That was...

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:28.230
Next time: Mysterious Power
